	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 大六天魔王と畏れられ、天下にその名を轟かせた“織田信長頑駄無”が遂に登場！ ■ツヤのあるグロスインジェクション成形の鎧に、実物を元にアレンジされた金色の兜飾りを装着。 ■ワンタッチで肩鎧が変形するスプリングギミック搭載。 ■織田軍の幟と足軽兵雑魚（あしがるへいざこ）が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• “Oda Nobunaga Gundamu”, feared as the Great Six Heavenly Demon Lords and famous all over the world, is finally here! ■Golden helmet decoration arranged based on the real thing is attached to the glossy gloss injection molded armor. ■Equipped with a spring gimmick that transforms the shoulder armor with one touch. ■Oda army flag and ashigaru heizako (foot soldiers) are included."
		]
